# SKYWELL: a bat sleeps until Kip passes close or underneath, then flutters
# after her, slower than she runs. Its touch doesn't hurt, but the knock is
# dangerous: she is flung hard across the shaft, out of control for almost
# a second, and unless a platform catches her she drops floors towards the
# Grinder. When she comes round she still has her jump in the air.
# Recovery shortens the knock.
game skywell
wait 5
press A
cheat clear
cheat plat 0 0 0 13
wait 5
# a bat up and to the left stays asleep while Kip is out of the way
cheat foe 0 20 -100
wait 30
expect bats_awake == 0
# she walks underneath it: it wakes
hold LEFT 40
expect bats_awake == 1
# she runs away and it falls behind
hold RIGHT 60
expect kx > 120
expect foe0_x < 60
# standing still, it catches up and bumps her: a long knock, flung far
wait 112
expect stun > 50
expect state == 1
wait 12
expect kx > 160
wait 50
expect stun == 0
expect state == 1
# knocked off a high ledge with nothing below: she falls into the Grinder
cheat clear
cheat plat 0 80 -300 3
cheat pos 100 -312
wait 20
expect ground == 1
cheat foe 0 116 -312
wait 90
expect state == 2
# again, with a platform two floors down: it catches her
wait 80
press A
cheat clear
cheat plat 0 80 -300 3
cheat plat 0 0 -236 13
cheat pos 100 -312
wait 20
cheat foe 0 116 -312
wait 60
expect state == 1
expect ground == 1
expect ky == -248
# four Recoveries: the knock is at its shortest, and when she comes round
# in the air she still has her jump in the air
cheat run
cheat clear
cheat plat 0 0 -120 13
cheat give 0
cheat give 0
cheat give 0
cheat give 0
cheat pos 100 -312
cheat foe 0 104 -310
wait 2
expect stun > 15
expect stun <= 20
expect air_used == 0
wait 20
expect stun == 0
expect ground == 0
press A
expect air_used == 1
expect vy10 < 0
